  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Beside Yi Yu at the lakeside he says that without his unique investigative killer move he would not have found the ancient water monster under smoky warm jade field. He names Yi clan as most skilled at water path and a super force that can explain itself if exposed. He has rank seven cultivation while Yi Yu is rank six, and he activates a concealed immortal killer move to wake the monster.",
      "chapters": [
        1533
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_yi_yu",
        "fac_yi_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He reads that the erupting beast is someone’s pet rather than a free kill for Yi clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1534
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "plan-and-aftermath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan arrives he has an ugly expression, ignores Yi clan plans, and tries to conceal his aura to the limit, telling Yi Yu they must fight to the death if found.",
      "chapters": [
        1535
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "plan-and-aftermath",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Lu Wei Yin speaks he is stunned with Tie Mian Shen and Yi Yu, then asks the senior to open the battlefield so they can return to their clan.",
      "chapters": [
        1539
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
